   :graph/usage-guide {:guide/purpose "The BSIC Kolkata AI and automation portfolio: products by domain, stages, HC (fact = released, target = confirmed, forecast = potential), the IT and business status lights, owners, timeline updates, questions Q1 …, cards (proposed changes) and weekly reports."
